{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dragon Expedition is a fantasy adventure game that tells the story of the Eastern world being controlled by an unidentified robot prophet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> The girl unexpectedly becomes involved in this conspiracy and becomes a dragon slayer warrior, heading alone to the Western demon world to search for the Dragon Crystal and save her home. From then on, embark on the long journey of slaying demons and collecting dragon eggs. The game includes different scenes from the East and the West, with various monsters waiting for you to challenge. The unique gameplay of Royal Dragon Air Combat will bring you a different experience. Is it defeating the dragon to save our home? Or have they been conquered by evil forces? Only by embarking on a long journey and writing fate with a sword can we obtain the final answer!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">1. Control the flying dragon for high-altitude combat and engage in an air-to-air confrontation with the evil dragon.\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435310/extras/gif.gif?t=1747362753\" />  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435310/extras/\u5c4f\u5e55\u622a\u56fe_2025-05-07_160936.png?t=1747362753\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">2. Multiple scenes to explore freely.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435310/extras/\u5c4f\u5e55\u622a\u56fe_2025-05-07_145539.png?t=1747362753\" /> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435310/extras/\u5c4f\u5e55\u622a\u56fe_2025-05-07_145704.png?t=1747362753\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">3. Multiple skills will lend you a helping hand.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435310/extras/517200.png?t=1747362753\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">4. Different bosses bring you different combat experiences.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435310/extras/\u5c4f\u5e55\u622a\u56fe_2025-05-07_153103.png?t=1747362753\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">5.Whether the Eastern world can return to its golden age and prosperity lies in your sword.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435310/extras/\u5c4f\u5e55\u622a\u56fe_2025-05-07_152947.png?t=1747362753\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3435310?t=1747362753","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3435310?t=1747362753","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435310/28aabce627b17e0e049e08d78f6692376ab53835/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747362753","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435310/28aabce627b17e0e049e08d78f6692376ab53835/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747362753","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"The content contained in this game may not be suitable for all age groups or should not be accessed during work hours.some scenes have common adult content with revealing clothing"},"demos":[{"appid":3